e":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n关将军失去亲人的悲痛，\n貂蝉可以理解。\n&曹操\n…………"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":4,"offset":14293,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":14318,"body_end":14398,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[19]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n不过真是令人百思不解，\n孔明为何做出此等叛逆之事……？"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":5,"offset":14398,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":14423,"body_end":14680,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n孟德，孔明的大哥好像在东吴吧？\n&曹操\n诸葛瑾吗？\n&夏侯惇\n对对，就是他。\n是诸葛瑾劝说孔明谋反的吧？\n&曹操\n这点令人难以相信，\n因为诸葛瑾的人品很好，\n不像是会用这种卑鄙手段的人。\n&曹操\n即使是兄长劝说，\n我看孔明也不会因此而背叛主公的。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":6,"offset":14680,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":14705,"body_end":14812,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[3]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n云长，斗志高昂固然可嘉，\n但若过于感情冲动，就无法取胜了。\n&关羽\n是，关某谨遵教诲。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":7,"offset":14812,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":14837,"body_end":14919,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[23]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&贾诩\n青龙偃月刀、青龍戰袍和赤兔马，\n都是天下难得一见的至宝啊。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]}]}